OL,3,GNEWSAMan raped teenage girl after
OL,4,Aabducting her in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of raping a
OL,7,Fteenage girl he abducted from a park.
OL,9,FJay Savage, 33, grabbed his victim and
OL,10,Fthreatened to stab her after he
OL,11,Ffollowed the girl into a dark area of
OL,12,FCentral Park in Boston, Lincolnshire,
OL,13,Fin March.
OL,15,FLincoln Crown Court was told Savage was
OL,16,Fseen on CCTV marching the girl to his
OL,17,Fhotel, where he filmed himself sexually
OL,18,Fassaulting her.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
